  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5543,
      "text": "So the intercession of intercessors will not benefit them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5544,
      "text": "Then what is the matter with them that they turn away from the Reminder,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5545,
      "text": "as if they were terrified wild asses,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5546,
      "text": "fleeing from a lion?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5547,
      "text": "In fact, each one of them desires that open [divine] letters be sent to each of them[11].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5548,
      "text": "By no means! They rather do not fear the Hereafter.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5549,
      "text": "No indeed! This [Qur’an] is a reminder.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5550,
      "text": "So whoever wills may take heed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5551,
      "text": "But they will not take heed unless Allah so wills. He is most worthy to be feared and most worthy to forgive.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 74,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُدَّثِّرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muddaththir",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cloaked One",
        "numberOfAyahs": 56,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 511,
      "hizbQuarter": 230,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5552,
      "text": "I swear by the Day of Resurrection,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5553,
      "text": "and I swear by the self-reproaching soul[1]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5554,
      "text": "Does man think that We cannot reassemble his bones?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5555,
      "text": "In fact, We are able to restore even his very fingertips.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5556,
      "text": "But man desires to persist in sin[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5557,
      "text": "and asks [mockingly], “When is the Day of Resurrection?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5558,
      "text": "But when the sight is dazzled,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5559,
      "text": "and the moon is darkened,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5560,
      "text": "and the sun and the moon are brought together[3],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5561,
      "text": "on that Day man will say, “Where is the escape?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5562,
      "text": "No indeed! There will be no refuge.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5563,
      "text": "On that Day all will end up before your Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5564,
      "text": "On that Day man will be informed of what he has sent forth[4] and left behind[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5565,
      "text": "In fact, man will be a witness against himself[6],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5566,
      "text": "despite the excuses he may put forward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5567,
      "text": "Do not move your tongue [O Prophet] in haste trying to memorize it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5568,
      "text": "It is upon Us to make you memorize and recite it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5569,
      "text": "Then when We recite it [through Gabriel], follow its recitation attentively;",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 577,
      "ruku": 512,
      "hizbQuarter": 231,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5570,
      "text": "then it is upon Us to explain its meanings.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 75,
        "name": "سُورَةُ القِيَامَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Qiyaama",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Resurrection",
        "numberOfAyahs": 40,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 29,
